sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Operative as User / Operative Browser
    participant Client as Frontend (TanStack / Zustand)
    participant Server as Express API (/api/auth)
    participant DB as MongoDB Atlas (users)
    participant Email as Email Relay (GAS)

    %% Registration Flow
    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Operative, DB: 1. REGISTRATION & VERIFICATION FLOW
        Operative->>Client: Submit Registration Form (Name, Email, Password, Role)
        Client->>Server: POST /api/auth/register
        Server->>DB: Check if email exists
        alt Email already registered
            Server-->>Client: 400 Bad Request ("Account already exists")
        else Email is new
            Server->>Server: Hash password (bcrypt salt 10)
            Server->>Server: Generate 6-digit numeric OTP
            Server->>DB: Save User record (isVerified: false, otpCode)
            Server->>Email: Dispatch Verification OTP email
            Server-->>Client: 201 Created (Redirect to /auth/otp)
            Operative->>Client: Enter 6-digit OTP
            Client->>Server: POST /api/auth/verify-otp { email, otp }
            Server->>DB: Validate OTP & mark isVerified: true
            Server-->>Client: 200 OK (Verification Confirmed)
        end
    end

    %% Login Flow
    rect rgb(255, 250, 240)
        Note over Operative, DB: 2. AUTHENTICATION & JWT ISSUANCE
        Operative->>Client: Enter Credentials (Email & Password)
        Client->>Server: POST /api/auth/login { email, password }
        Server->>DB: Find user by email
        alt Invalid credentials
            Server-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized ("Invalid credentials")
        else Valid credentials
            Server->>Server: Verify bcrypt hash match
            Server->>Server: Sign JWT payload { id, email, role } (7d expiry)
            Server-->>Client: 200 OK { token, user: { id, name, email, role } }
            Client->>Client: Store token in localStorage (codesrijan_auth_token)
            Client->>Client: Hydrate Zustand Store (currentUser, token)
            Client-->>Operative: Redirect to /dashboard (Role-Gated Landing)
        end
    end

    %% Authenticated Requests & RBAC
    rect rgb(245, 255, 245)
        Note over Operative, DB: 3. PROTECTED API REQUEST & RBAC GATE
        Operative->>Client: Navigate to /admin/hackathons
        Client->>Server: GET /api/admin/hackathons (Authorization: Bearer <JWT>)
        Server->>Server: requireAuth middleware (Verify JWT signature & expiry)
        alt Token Missing or Invalid
            Server-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized
            Client->>Client: Evict token, redirect to /login
        else Token Valid
            Server->>Server: requireRole(['admin']) middleware
            alt Role != 'admin'
                Server-->>Client: 403 Forbidden ("Administrative clearance denied")
            else Role == 'admin'
                Server->>DB: Query administrative records
                Server-->>Client: 200 OK [ hackathon records ]
            end
        end
    end

    %% Session Termination
    rect rgb(255, 240, 245)
        Note over Operative, Client: 4. SESSION TERMINATION (LOGOUT)
        Operative->>Client: Click "Terminate Session (Logout)"
        Client->>Client: Clear localStorage & sessionStorage
        Client->>Client: Reset Zustand store (currentUser = null)
        Client-->>Operative: Redirect to /login
    end
